# The repo-wide `*.log` rule (.gitignore:60) would silently swallow this fixture.
#
# These filenames are NOT cosmetic: `find_iterations_logs` globs
# `precice-*-iterations.log` and `watchpoint_path` builds
# `precice-<Participant>-watchpoint-<name>.log`, so renaming them to dodge the ignore
# rule would stop the fixture exercising the code paths it exists to pin. Re-include
# them here instead.
!*.log
